			"notes": "Things were broken and non functional. Now they work a bit better!\n\n- Pickaxes are no longer broken\n\n> Don't know what entirely I did but I fixed it.\n\n- Vex Evokation has simple functionality (Vex still attack you so be careful)\n\nThere is a new Soulbound effect (Non-functional)\n\nPrism and Copperbound Prism removed\n\n> Felt that these items did not fit the scope of the mod but may appear in another mod.\n\n- Modified Loot tables so that abyss and soul can be found in the world so that you can craft abyssium equipment. \n\nRecipe book support coming soon.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/TFoley1/join_the_illagers-1.20.1/compare/snapshot_3...snapshot_4"
